    "cues": [
      {"id": "CUE-001", "start": 0, "end": 5.12, "text": "三天的工作十分钟搞定电商老板们的噩梦，终于有救了，浙江有一家女装品牌", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-001.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-001", "SHOT-002", "SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-002", "start": 5.12, "end": 8.9, "text": "她们的运营啊，每周都要去各个平台一条一条的复制商品评论", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-003", "start": 8.91, "end": 13.511, "text": "然后手动录入到excel表格里，光是数据清洗就要整整花上三天的时间", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003"]},
      {"id": "CUE-004", "start": 13.511, "end": 15.58, "text": "时间人力成本高，效率也低", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-003", "SHOT-004"]},
      {"id": "CUE-005", "start": 15.59, "end": 20.35, "text": "但我发现钉钉有一个颠覆性的产品可以完美的解决这个问题，那就是多维表", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-005.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-004", "SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-006", "start": 20.35, "end": 22.61, "text": "它针对电商场景推出了一百多个模板", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-006.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-007", "start": 22.62, "end": 28.02, "text": "比如就拿这个折磨老板的抓取评价来说，多表可以自动的抓取天猫淘宝的评价数据", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-007.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-008", "start": 28.02, "end": 31.89, "text": "然后自动帮你分析评价。自动分类正面负面中性评论", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-008.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005"]},
      {"id": "CUE-009", "start": 31.89, "end": 35.05, "text": "还能智能提取对应商品，那这套系统到底怎么用呢？", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-009.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-005", "SHOT-006"]},
      {"id": "CUE-010", "start": 35.05, "end": 38.99, "text": "来手把手教你，我们打开钉钉，点击左侧这里的多维表", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-010.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-006", "SHOT-007"]},
      {"id": "CUE-011", "start": 39, "end": 43.99, "text": "启动电商评价ai系统，这个模板进来以后上传有评价数据的excel表格", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-011.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-007", "SHOT-008"]},
      {"id": "CUE-012", "start": 44, "end": 48.82, "text": "Ai会自动提取里面的评价，然后它可以自动识别这套评价是正面还是负面", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-012.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-008", "SHOT-009"]},
      {"id": "CUE-013", "start": 48.82, "end": 52.58, "text": "对应的商品是什么。客服应该如何解决都写得清清楚楚", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-013.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-009", "SHOT-010"]},
      {"id": "CUE-014", "start": 52.58, "end": 57.06, "text": "比如哪些是正面评论，哪些是差评，哪些是中性评论，以及在这些差评里", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-014.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-010"]},
      {"id": "CUE-015", "start": 57.07, "end": 59.27, "text": "主要的问题是哪些？什么物流啊", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-015.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-010"]},
      {"id": "CUE-016", "start": 59.27, "end": 61.71, "text": "产品问题呀，客服应该怎么解决啊？", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-016.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-010"]},
      {"id": "CUE-017", "start": 61.71, "end": 66.64, "text": "它都自动生成了。你甚至可以直接一键把它作为可视画图", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-017.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-010", "SHOT-011", "SHOT-012"]},
      {"id": "CUE-018", "start": 66.64, "end": 71.35, "text": "对了还有个小功能，在这里可以设置自动化推送，比如一旦有了差评五条", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-018.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-012", "SHOT-013", "SHOT-014"]},
      {"id": "CUE-019", "start": 71.36, "end": 74.68, "text": "他就会自动发消息到群里，这样就不用时时刻刻盯着后台了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-019.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-014", "SHOT-015", "SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-020", "start": 74.68, "end": 76.76, "text": "真的全流程自动化真的太强了", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-020.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id": "CUE-021", "start": 76.77, "end": 81.77, "text": "就是这家浙江女装品牌，用了这套系统之后，原来需要三天才能完成的数据清洗工作", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-021.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-016", "SHOT-017"]},
      {"id": "CUE-022", "start": 81.77, "end": 85.12, "text": "现在十分钟就能搞定了，效率直接提升了百分之九十六", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-022.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-017"]},
      {"id": "CUE-023", "start": 85.13, "end": 88.21, "text": "说实话，这种人工excel到智能化管家的跨越", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-023.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-017", "SHOT-018"]},
      {"id": "CUE-024", "start": 88.21, "end": 92.37, "text": "让我想到了以前只有大厂才有的数据分析能力，现在连小店都能免费拥有", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-024.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-018"]},
      {"id": "CUE-025", "start": 92.37, "end": 93.576, "text": "朋友们快用起来吧", "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-025.jpg", "overlappingShots": ["SHOT-018"]}
    ]
  },
